    "title": "Margaret Hansen - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago Our beautiful mother, and beloved grandmother, Margaret Ann Hansen, 80, passed away peacefully, on November 14, 2025, at Life Care Center of Idaho Falls. Margaret was born April 25, 1945, in Alameda, California, to Ruth and Earl Church. She was the youngest of three sisters. At a young age, Margaret moved with her family to Salmon, Idaho, where she spent most of her childhood. The family eventually moved to Idaho Falls where she would live, work, and raise her family. Margaret’s greatest joy was raising and caring for her family. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
